/Title (Objectives and Process This project aimed to bring a workable redesign of the Salt River Tubing homepage, which had been broken and mostly empty for several years. I wanted to make a mockup showing how the site could be reworked using both existing assets and a new color scheme for desktop, tablet, and mobile viewing. I used Photoshop and Figma to edit assets and develop mockups for each viewport size.)
